<title>ALBANIA: Albanian chrome output down in second quarter.</title>
<headline>Albanian chrome output down in second quarter.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania's Institute of Statistics reported the following economic indicators on Wednesday -</p>
<p> ALBANIAN CHROME OUTPUT		1996 Q2   1995 Q2    Change</p>
<p> Total chrome ore (tonnes)	   37,242    58,900    -21,658</p>
<p> High grade chrome ore (tonnes)    28,164    40,000    -11,836</p>
<p> Chrome concentrate (tonnes)	  9,523    12,000     -2,477</p>
<p> Ferrochromium (tonnes)		 9,758    13,100     -3,342</p>
<p>-- Tirana Newsroom +355 42 62228</p>
</text>
